WEBVTT

18:03.275 --> 18:05.277
How do you feel?

18:08.989 --> 18:10.991
You still don't remember anything?

18:13.035 --> 18:17.164
Bran, I've seen you climb
a thousand times.

18:17.289 --> 18:19.083
In the wind, in the rain...

18:19.208 --> 18:21.251
A thousand times.

18:21.377 --> 18:23.587
- You never fall.
- I did though.

18:26.674 --> 18:28.884
It's true, isn't it,

18:29.009 --> 18:32.221
what Maester Luwin says about my legs?
